{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This demo</strong> includes a portion of the main campaign and a few Challenge Mode levels that let you put your skills to the test. You can explore the core gameplay mechanics and experiment with some of the available abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Speedrun Mode is not included in this version.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please consider reporting any bugs or issues that bother you, I want to try to create the best experience and game possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Emerge from the depths of the ocean and wield the power of a guardian of the seas, as chaos consumes fully destructible environments with unstoppable speed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dash through an island of unique levels, packed with challenges and unexpected encounters. Stay relentless, hunt down the mad scientist, and leave a fast-moving trail of destruction in your wake!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050790/extras/87c2b4106070372199fdbca1414ecf70.webp?t=1760377944\" width=618 height=60 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Destroy everything, absolutely everything! </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-time physics that allow you to collapse the environment in your own way. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the environment as a weapon and throw objects at enemies and structures.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050790/extras/648e0102735d72ab725fc64e10d6236d.poster.avif?t=1760377944\" width=1170 height=572 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050790/extras/648e0102735d72ab725fc64e10d6236d.webm?t=1760377944\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Progression and Hats!?\u00a0</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Gain new abilities to become stronger, faster, and more destructive.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Collect hats! Creates chaos, but with style.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050790/extras/e38425221f22a1909794a0b2f88c8f6b.poster.avif?t=1760377944\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050790/extras/e38425221f22a1909794a0b2f88c8f6b.webm?t=1760377944\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050790/extras/e38425221f22a1909794a0b2f88c8f6b.mp4?t=1760377944\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050790/extras/7bdccbd466db351b8106fbda6110a3b9.poster.avif?t=1760377944\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050790/extras/7bdccbd466db351b8106fbda6110a3b9.webm?t=1760377944\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050790/extras/7bdccbd466db351b8106fbda6110a3b9.mp4?t=1760377944\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ready for More? Dive Into Extra Modes!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_